In addition to these reels and rows, Novomatic have added a total of nine separate pay lines. All of these are able to be easily altered, ranging from a single one up to three, five, seven and the maximum of nine. Furthermore, the value of a single credit in the game can be changed between $0.50 and up to $1 and finally, $2. Also,[ players are also] able to change around the bet placed per line, which will range from its minimum of one and increase up to the maximum of 100. Overall,[ players are] able to place a maximum w[ager] per round of $900.
